  "term": "attitude",
  "definition": "An attitude is a relatively lasting, learned tendency to respond in a consistent way toward a particular kind of thing or situation. It can also mean a continuing state of mental or neural readiness to react to something as it is perceived or understood, rather than simply as it is.",
